        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon okolimok ayoŋ aeikin eete ŋolo ka aumonokin lo aŋuna a ŋidwe a ŋiarei a ŋulu a ŋirwosi a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.19.1",
